{"scene_id": "pt_enemy_3", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/pdtrain/scenes/pt_enemy_3.fountain", "heading": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann (who sits knitting).", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you sail soon, Captain Horster?", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "I expect to be ready to sail next week.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "I suppose you are going to America?", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, that is the plan.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Then you won't be able to take part in the coming election?", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "Is there going to be an election?", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Didn't you know?", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "No, I don't mix myself up with those things.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "But do you not take an interest in public affairs?", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "No, I don't know anything about politics.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "All the same, one ought to vote, at any rate.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Even if one doesn't know anything about what is going on?", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "Doesn't know!", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "What do you mean by that?", "para": 12, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "A community is like a ship; everyone ought to be prepared to take the helm.", "para": 12, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "Maybe that is all very well on shore; but on board ship it wouldn't work.", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "It is astonishing how little most sailors care about what goes on on shore.", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "Very extraordinary.", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "Sailors are like birds of passage; they feel equally at home in any latitude.", "para": 16, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "And that is only an additional reason for our being all the more keen, Hovstad.", "para": 16, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "Is there to be anything of public interest in tomorrow's \"Messenger\"?", "para": 16, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "Nothing about municipal affairs.", "para": 17, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "But the day after tomorrow I was thinking of printing your article\u2014", "para": 17, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "Ah, devil take it\u2014my article!", "para": 18, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "Look here, that must wait a bit.", "para": 18, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "Really?", "para": 19, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "We had just got convenient space for it, and I thought it was just the opportune moment\u2014", "para": 19, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, yes, very likely you are right; but it must wait all the same.", "para": 20, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "I will explain to you later.", "para": 20, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "(PETRA comes in from the hall, in hat and cloak and with a bundle of exercise books under her arm.)", "para": 20, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 21, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "Good evening.", "para": 21, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 22, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "Good evening, Petra; come along.", "para": 22, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "(Mutual greetings; PETRA takes off her things and puts them down on a chair by the door.)", "para": 23, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 24, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "And you have all been sitting here enjoying yourselves, while I have been out slaving!", "para": 24, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 25, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, come and enjoy yourself too!", "para": 25, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 26, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "May I mix a glass for you?", "para": 26, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra (coming to the table).", "para": 27, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "Thanks, I would rather do it; you always mix it too strong.", "para": 27, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "But I forgot, father\u2014I have a letter for you.", "para": 27, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "(Goes to the chair where she has laid her things.)", "para": 27, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 28, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "A letter?", "para": 28, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "From whom?", "para": 28, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra (looking in her coat pocket).", "para": 29, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "The postman gave it to me just as I was going out.", "para": 29, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (getting up and going to her).", "para": 30, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "And you only give to me now!", "para": 30, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 31, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "I really had not time to run up again.", "para": 31, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "There it is!", "para": 31, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 77, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (seizing the letter).", "para": 32, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 78, "kind": "action", "text": "Let's see, let's see, child!", "para": 32, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 79, "kind": "action", "text": "(Looks at the address.)", "para": 32, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 80, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, that's all right!", "para": 32, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 81, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 33, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 82, "kind": "action", "text": "Is it the one you have been expecting go anxiously, Thomas?", "para": 33, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 83, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 34, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 84, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, it is.", "para": 34, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 85, "kind": "action", "text": "I must go to my room now and\u2014 Where shall I get a light, Katherine?", "para": 34, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 86, "kind": "action", "text": "Is there no lamp in my room again?", "para": 34, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 87, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 35, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 88, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, your lamp is already lit on your desk.", "para": 35, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 89, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 36, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 90, "kind": "action", "text": "Good, good.", "para": 36, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 91, "kind": "action", "text": "Excuse me for a moment\u2014, (Goes into his study.)", "para": 36, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 92, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 37, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 93, "kind": "action", "text": "What do you suppose it is, mother?", "para": 37, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 94, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 38, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 95, "kind": "action", "text": "I don't know; for the last day or two he has always been asking if the postman has not been.", "para": 38, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 96, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 39, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 97, "kind": "action", "text": "Probably some country patient.", "para": 39, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 98, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 40, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 99, "kind": "action", "text": "Poor old dad!\u2014he will overwork himself soon.", "para": 40, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 100, "kind": "action", "text": "(Mixes a glass for herself.)", "para": 40, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 101, "kind": "action", "text": "There, that will taste good!", "para": 40, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 102, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 41, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 103, "kind": "action", "text": "Have you been teaching in the evening school again today?", "para": 41, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 104, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra (sipping from her glass).", "para": 42, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 105, "kind": "action", "text": "Two hours.", "para": 42, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 106, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 43, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 107, "kind": "action", "text": "And four hours of school in the morning?", "para": 43, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 108, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 44, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 109, "kind": "action", "text": "Five hours.", "para": 44, "sent": 1, "present": []}]}